fcb.bin contains a FCB and was generated by this tool. It should instantly =
work with your i.mx53 barebox.
Note that the FCB image must reside within the first blocks of the NAND. Th=
e internal ROM loader will always read 4k blocks from NAND - independent of=
 the actual NAND page size.=20
The attached FCB must be located at the start of the NAND. The barebox imag=
e must be located at page 2.
Assuming a 2k page NAND you should have this:  page 0-1: 4k FCB, page 2-n: =
barebox.

~Matthias
